OL,3,GNEWSASome pupils 'slept in their cars'
OL,4,Aduring Ballymena riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe principal of a school that lost
OL,7,Falmost a fifth of its pupils in the
OL,8,Fwake of rioting in Ballymena has said
OL,9,Fstaff found themselves in a "completely
OL,10,Funprecedented situation".
OL,12,FA report into the effect of the
OL,13,F"racially motivated" disorder on young
OL,14,Fpeople has found that schools including
OL,15,FHarryville Primary School were seen as
OL,16,Fa safe haven for children whose homes
OL,17,Fwere under attack.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
