OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASome pupils 'slept in their cars'
OL,4,Aduring Ballymena riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it also found that 41 pupils
OL,7,Ffrom migrant families did not return to
OL,8,Fthe school, which had to arrange hotel
OL,9,Faccommodation for some who were afraid
OL,10,Fto return home.
OL,12,FPrincipal Neil McCullough said some
OL,13,Ffamilies slept in cars due to the fear
OL,14,Fof what was happening on the streets.
